{"id":"bugambilia-tmdb-1783856","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"Bugambilia","overview":"Cuatro años después de la cuarentena, Emiliano continúa encerrado en casa, utilizando la pandemia como pretexto para evitar enfrentarse al mundo y al duelo por la pérdida de su padre. Su única conexión con el exterior es Silvya, una joven que conoce en línea y que lo impulsa a salir de su aislamiento. Cuando ella decide visitarlo, Emiliano deberá elegir entre permanecer encerrado o enfrentarse a sus miedos por la posibilidad de comenzar de nuevo.","releaseDate":"2026-09-27","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCKEXCsKabkiUEolx8TAsUZxg2o.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1BS1mDAtKHWkTO4SDfCjWKfBWna.jpg","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1BS1mDAtKHWkTO4SDfCjWKfBWna.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yiSYa0QLTv3V4AALHJBufqRaAb3.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/u3oOknHLmCTV0wjFC6owJszsWlH.jpg","label":"Escena 03"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Eduardo \"Güero\" Jímenez","role":"Emiliano","personTmdbId":6514524,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Karla Estefanía","role":"Sylvia","personTmdbId":6514525,"department":"Acting"}],"crew":[{"name":"Diego Lugo","role":"Director","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zsJKU3u42QEwZMb0zllDIradQg.jpg","personTmdbId":5664332,"department":"Directing"},{"name":"Enrique Rosales","role":"Director of Photography","personTmdbId":5841791,"department":"Camera"},{"name":"Kat Aranch","role":"Production Design","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvcLOd694eLfnRr45QhN3CYTO8G.jpg","personTmdbId":5822294,"department":"Art"},{"name":"Alison Noemí","role":"BTS Footage","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A78WtvrkmyoFJb5Pve0RVaro0b6.jpg","personTmdbId":5171971,"department":"Camera"},{"name":"Samuel Escamirosa","role":"Producti